# FigDown — figures as text. Spec: https://github.com/FigDown/figdown
#
# Regression fixture for backlog item 66 (`TYPED-BLOCK-TITLE-CANVAS`). `table`'s own
# caption-width union was already fixed (`LABEL-PLACEMENT-METRIC`) — this fixture
# re-pins it under the SHARED helper (`typedBlockTitleW`) `TYPED-BLOCK-TITLE-CANVAS` introduced, so
# a future refactor of that helper cannot quietly regress the table case
# while fixing another. One column, one row: the smallest table a long
# caption can sit over. See bitfield-long-title.fd in this directory for why
# this file lives here rather than under examples/.

figdown 0.1 table

table tb "Status codes returned by the ingress classifier under overload"
| Code |
|------|
| 0    |
